"LGBT"]},{"word":"beatific","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"bewildering","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"blissful","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"celestial","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"delightful","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"divine","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"enchanting","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"extraordinary","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"fabulous","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"fantabulosa","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful","tags":["Polari"]},{"word":"fantabulous","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful","tags":["slang"]},{"word":"fascinating","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"finger-lickin' good","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful","tags":["figuratively"]},{"word":"frabjous","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"grandeur","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"grandiose","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"grand","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"great","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"heavenlike","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"heavenly","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"impressive","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"inspiring","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"lovely jubbly","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful","tags":["Britain","informal"]},{"word":"magnificent","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"majestic","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"major","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"marvellous/marvelous","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"mirandous","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"mystifying","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"phenomenal","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"selly","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful","tags":["Multicultural-London-English","Northern-England","Scotland"]},{"word":"splendid","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"stupefying","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"stupendous","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"supercalifragilisticexpialidocious","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"unbelievable","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"wild","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful","tags":["US"]},{"word":"wondrous","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"luxurious","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"}]},"Wonder Woman":{"id":"8febfd0d-cfdb-43f0-842f-7a0e4f501ff5","word":"Wonder Woman","trans":[{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"DC Comics character","word":"Mulher-Maravilha"}],"pos":"name","tags":null,"senses":[{"examples":[{"text":"It was just Wonder Woman whose secret identity threatened to overwhelm and swallow up the heroic reality. I think I was afraid that one day I'd innocently open that month's comic and find Diana Prince waking up to announce that Wonder Woman was only a dream after all.","ref":"2004, Lillian S[ara] Robinson, “The Book of Lilith”, in Wonder Women: Feminisms and Superheroes, New York, N.Y.; London: Routledge, →ISBN, page 12:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[12,24],[228,240]],"id":"f99c997f-9b7b-4bfa-a152-861640706b35"},{"text":"Wonder Woman is a recognizable figure: gold tiara, invisible jet, fights bad guys, looks like Lynda Carter. She's a role model for many, and the most famous female superhero in a genre dominated by males. She's also been a feminist icon since Gloria Steinem put her on the first cover of Ms. magazine in 1972. […] Wonder Woman was created during the Golden Age of comics, before the temporary workplace gains of World War II, at a time when women were told that their only place was in the home. An Amazon princess and the most powerful warrior of her race, Wonder Woman ignored these expectations. Her comics didn't just suggest equality of the sexes; they flat-out demonstrated that every woman had innate power and that Wonder Woman was superior to her male counterparts.","ref":"2014, Tim Hanley, “Introduction”, in Wonder Woman Unbound: The Curious History of the World's Most Famous Heroine, Chicago, Ill.: Chicago Review Press, →ISBN, pages x–xi:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[0,12],[314,326],[558,570],[723,735]],"id":"508d206f-80db-47e8-bb07-f3773d45ab03"}],"attestations":[{"date":"from 1941.","references":[]}],"links":[["superheroine","superheroine"]],"categories":["English terms with quotations"],"glosses":["A DC Comics superheroine."],"id":"16c32381-e2b7-4b8e-9ad3-b87bc28423b1"}],"related":[],"synonyms":[]},"wonderfully":{"id":"528a3e7c-6b37-4cba-99b3-c68a7a0726d0","word":"wonderfully","trans":[{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"in a wonderful manner","word":"maravilhosamente"},{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"to an extent inspiring wonder","word":"maravilhosamente"}],"pos":"adv","tags":null,"senses":[{"examples":[{"text":"He entertained us wonderfully.","bold_text_offsets":[[18,29]],"type":"example","id":"c98beb7d-dbae-4f0b-9c6b-8d1c612a19e8"},{"text":"By freeing statisticians from dealing with complicated calculations, the statistical aspects of a problem can become the main focus. This point is wonderfully illustrated by Smith and Gelfand (1992).","ref":"1992, Casella and George, Explaining the Gibbs Sampler, in: The American Statistician 46(3) 167–174","type":"quotation","id":"ba7042aa-b59a-4a68-8b0c-fac2582c9e1e"}],"links":[["wonderful","wonderful"],["excellent","excellent"]],"glosses":["In a wonderful manner.","In an excellent manner."],"categories":["English terms with quotations","English terms with usage examples"],"id":"c2f6155b-9cdd-44e0-a8dc-a91ea98ebab7"},{"examples":[{"text":"On a clear night, the Montana sky is wonderfully vast and full of stars.","bold_text_offsets":[[37,48]],"type":"example","id":"eb589a81-93a3-4bf5-8f94-bf3c260d8818"},{"text":"It was wonderfully stormy and dark on the night when the ship went down.","bold_text_offsets":[[7,18]],"type":"example","id":"df4664f0-c690-4788-a7b9-26c6b4fcd5b1"},{"text":"Although this run was made on Whitsun-Tuesday, and the traffic into London was heavy from all directions, we got a wonderfully clear road and apart from one slight check at Herne Hill were entirely undelayed.","ref":"1959 October 15, O. S. Nock, “British Locomotive Practice and Performance”, in Railway Magazine, page 705:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[115,126]],"id":"c00c9b8a-fb36-4da5-82a8-3f3e057e10f2"}],"links":[["wonderful","wonderful"],["wonder","wonder#Noun"]],"glosses":["In a wonderful manner.","To an extent inspiring wonder."],"synonyms":[{"word":"wondrously"}],"categories":["English terms with quotations","English terms with usage examples"],"id":"5a7dcf75-9a0e-4b06-8806-0edd95f36716"}],"related":[],"synonyms":[]},"wondrous":{"id":"19699e2a-e2ea-4755-b02f-31db2506f74b","word":"wondrous","trans":[{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"amazing, inspiring awe","word":"maravilhoso"}],"pos":"adj","tags":null,"senses":[{"examples":[{"text":"We all stared open-mouthed at the wondrous sight.","bold_text_offsets":[[34,42]],"type":"example","id":"044e7732-0f0c-4a7f-aaa4-832b8bb54c46"},{"text":"I'll show thee the best springs; I'll pluck thee berries; / I'll fish for thee, and get thee wood enough. / A plague upon the tyrant that I serve! / I'll bear him no more sticks, but follow thee, / Thou wondrous man.","ref":"1610–1611 (date written), William Shakespeare, “The Tempest”, in Mr. William Shakespeares Comedies, Histories, & Tragedies […] (First Folio), London: […] Isaac Iaggard, and Ed[ward] Blount, published 1623, →OCLC, [Act II, scene ii]:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[203,211]],"id":"90820fb2-7346-4d67-a523-889d0bd4d6c3"},{"text":"VVhen I ſurvey the vvondrous Croſs / VVhere the young Prince of Glory dy'd, / My richeſt Gain I count but Loſs, / And pour Contempt on all my Pride.","ref":"1707, I[saac] Watts, “Crucifixion to the World by the Cross of Christ; Gal[atians] 6. 14. [When I Survey the Wondrous Cross]”, in Hymns and Spiritual Songs. […], London: […] J. Humfreys, for John Lawrence, […], →OCLC, book III (Prepared for the Holy Ordinance of the Lord’s Supper), stanza 1, page 189:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[19,28]],"id":"cad836cb-4971-4cf4-b44c-66fa92f664a5"}],"links":[["Wonderful","wonderful"],["amazing","amazing"],["marvelous","marvelous"]],"synonyms":[{"word":"awesome","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"based","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"beat","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful","tags":["slang"]},{"word":"beatific","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"bewildering","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"blissful","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"celestial","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"delightful","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"divine","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"enchanting","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"extraordinary","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"fabulous","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"fantabulosa","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful","tags":["Polari"]},{"word":"fantabulous","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful","tags":["slang"]},{"word":"fascinating","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"finger-lickin' good","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful","tags":["figuratively"]},{"word":"frabjous","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"grandeur","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"grandiose","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"grand","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"great","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"heavenlike","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"heavenly","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"impressive","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"inspiring","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"lovely jubbly","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful","tags":["Britain","informal"]},{"word":"magnificent","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"majestic","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"major","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"marvellous/marvelous","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"mirandous","source":"Thesaurus:wonderful"},{"word":"mystifying","sou